  "definition": "“Games of chance” mean bingo, beano, keno, raffles, lotteries, pull-tabs, scratch-offs, pari-mutuel betting, poker tournaments, Calcutta, wagering, pickle jars,",
  "effectiveDate": "2010-04-02",
